Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"cockroachdb__20": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（IMPORT 读外部存储；无 FDW/外部表）。 可从外部存储 IMPORT，但那是导入不是联邦查询 官方文档。 无 postgres_fdw 等外部表机制 社区共识。 跨库查询需求一般在应用层或用 CDC 同步后解决 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（IMPORT 读外部存储；无 FDW/外部表）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>可从外部存储 IMPORT，但那是导入不是联邦查询 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无 postgres_fdw 等外部表机制 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>跨库查询需求一般在应用层或用 CDC 同步后解决 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (IMPORT reads external storage; no FDW/external tables). Can IMPORT from external storage, but that is ingestion, not federated querying (official doc…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (IMPORT reads external storage; no FDW/external tables).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Can IMPORT from external storage, but that is ingestion, not federated querying <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No postgres_fdw-style external table mechanism <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-database queries are typically solved in the app layer or via CDC sync <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__21": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（CHANGEFEED 一等公民：Kafka/云存储/webhook）。 CHANGEFEED 可把行级变更推到 Kafka、云存储（Parquet/CSV）、webhook 官方文档。 支持 Avro/JSON 信封，可做下游流处理 官方文档。 大事务变更 feed 延迟与内存是已知调优点 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（CHANGEFEED 一等公民：Kafka/云存储/webhook）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CHANGEFEED 可把行级变更推到 Kafka、云存储（Parquet/CSV）、webhook <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>支持 Avro/JSON 信封，可做下游流处理 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大事务变更 feed 延迟与内存是已知调优点 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (First-class CHANGEFEED: Kafka/cloud storage/webhook). CHANGEFEED streams row changes to Kafka, cloud storage (Parquet/CSV) and webhooks <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Avro/J…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (First-class CHANGEFEED: Kafka/cloud storage/webhook).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CHANGEFEED streams row changes to Kafka, cloud storage (Parquet/CSV) and webhooks <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Avro/JSON envelopes for downstream stream processing <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Changefeed lag and memory on huge transactions are known tuning points <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__22": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（无原生 TTL；靠 scheduled job 定时删）。 无原生行级 TTL，需用 scheduled job 机制跑定时 DELETE 官方文档。 大表定时删注意拆批，避免长事务拖慢 MVCC GC 社区共识。 原生 TTL 的 feature request 长期 open，短期别指望 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（无原生 TTL；靠 scheduled job 定时删）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无原生行级 TTL，需用 scheduled job 机制跑定时 DELETE <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>大表定时删注意拆批，避免长事务拖慢 MVCC GC <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>原生 TTL 的 feature request 长期 open，短期别指望 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No native</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (No native TTL; scheduled jobs for periodic deletes). No native row-level TTL; use scheduled jobs running periodic DELETEs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Batch large deletes to…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (No native TTL; scheduled jobs for periodic deletes).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native row-level TTL; use scheduled jobs running periodic DELETEs <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Batch large deletes to avoid long transactions slowing MVCC GC <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>The native-TTL feature request has been open for years; don&#x27;t count on it soon <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__23": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（四类全在线；DDL 默认非事务性）。 只改定义：加可空列、重命名、删列（打标记）、COMMENT 只改系统表元数据，代价 O(1) 与表大小无关 官方文档。 重写数据：改列类型、加二级索引走后台分布式回填，读写不阻塞；大回填可能临时占用至约 3 倍存储，官方建议低峰执行 官方文档。 搬数据：ALTER TABLE … ALTER PR…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（四类全在线；DDL 默认非事务性）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>只改定义：加可空列、重命名、删列（打标记）、COMMENT 只改系统表元数据，代价 O(1) 与表大小无关 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>重写数据：改列类型、加二级索引走后台分布式回填，读写不阻塞；大回填可能临时占用至约 3 倍存储，官方建议低峰执行 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>搬数据：<code>ALTER TABLE … ALTER PRIMARY KEY</code> 与 <code>SET LOCALITY</code> 均在线执行；但主键变更进行中同表禁止其他在线变更 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>验证约束：支持 <code>NOT VALID</code> 先加约束、再 <code>VALIDATE CONSTRAINT</code> 分阶段验证 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>规模：第二、四类代价 O(n)，小表大表两个世界；大回填耗算力，官方明确建议低峰执行 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>语义：DDL 一般不入事务（官方已知限制；多语句事务中 DDL 可能部分提交，错误码 XXA00）；删列回滚可能无法正确恢复（官方已知限制）；变更以 job 运行，<code>SHOW JOBS</code> 监控、可暂停/恢复/取消 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。（依据 v26.x 官方文档，2026-10-02 核验）</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (All four classes online; DDL is non-transactional by default). Definition-only: adding nullable columns, renames, column drops (tombstoned), and comments touch…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (All four classes online; DDL is non-transactional by default).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Definition-only: adding nullable columns, renames, column drops (tombstoned), and comments touch only catalog metadata — O(1), independent of table size <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Data-rewriting: column type changes and secondary-index builds run as distributed background backfills without blocking reads/writes; large backfills can temporarily need ~3x storage — run them off-peak <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Data-moving: <code>ALTER TABLE … ALTER PRIMARY KEY</code> and <code>SET LOCALITY</code> both execute online; no other online schema change may start on the same table while a primary-key change is in progress <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Constraint validation: <code>NOT VALID</code> constraints followed by staged <code>VALIDATE CONSTRAINT</code> are supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Scale: classes 2 and 4 cost O(n) — small and large tables are two different worlds; large backfills consume compute, and official docs advise off-peak execution <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Semantics: DDL generally does not run inside transactions (documented limitation; DDL in multi-statement transactions can partially commit, error code XXA00); column-drop rollbacks may not restore correctly (documented limitation); changes run as jobs — monitor with <code>SHOW JOBS</code>, pausable/resumable/cancelable <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. (Per official docs on the v26.x line; verified 2026-10-02)</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__24": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（admission control 有限；无租户资源组）。 admission control 做过载保护，但不是租户级 QoS 官方文档。 多租户靠多集群/多 database 逻辑隔离 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（admission control 有限；无租户资源组）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>admission control 做过载保护，但不是租户级 QoS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>多租户靠多集群/多 database 逻辑隔离 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Limited admission control; no tenant resource groups). Admission control guards against overload, but it is not tenant-level QoS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Multi-tenancy v…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Limited admission control; no tenant resource groups).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Admission control guards against overload, but it is not tenant-level QoS <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Multi-tenancy via multiple clusters/databases for logical isolation <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__25": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（多 region 生存目标，原生多活）。 REGIONAL BY ROW 等生存目标，数据放离用户近的 region 官方文档。 多 region 写原生支持，follower 读降低跨区读延迟 官方文档。 跨区事务延迟是物理上限，设计表时要分区裁剪 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（多 region 生存目标，原生多活）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>REGIONAL BY ROW 等生存目标，数据放离用户近的 region <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>多 region 写原生支持，follower 读降低跨区读延迟 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨区事务延迟是物理上限，设计表时要分区裁剪 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Multi-region survival goals; native active-active). Survival goals like REGIONAL BY ROW pin data near users <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Native multi-region writes; follow…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Multi-region survival goals; native active-active).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Survival goals like REGIONAL BY ROW pin data near users <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Native multi-region writes; follower reads cut cross-region read latency <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-region transaction latency is a physics limit — design tables for partition pruning <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__26": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Raft 自愈，RTO 秒级）。 Raft 多副本，节点故障自动选主，RTO 秒级 官方文档。 RPO=0（多数派提交），脑裂靠 Raft 任期防护 官方文档。 多活架构下单节点故障业务几乎无感 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Raft 自愈，RTO 秒级）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Raft 多副本，节点故障自动选主，RTO 秒级 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>RPO=0（多数派提交），脑裂靠 Raft 任期防护 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>多活架构下单节点故障业务几乎无感 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Raft self-healing; seconds of RTO). Raft multi-replica; failed nodes trigger automatic re-election in seconds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. RPO=0 (majority commit); Raft te…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Raft self-healing; seconds of RTO).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Raft multi-replica; failed nodes trigger automatic re-election in seconds <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>RPO=0 (majority commit); Raft terms guard against split-brain <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>In active-active setups single-node failure is nearly invisible to traffic <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__27": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-tbd\">未找到证据</span><p class=\"snippet\">未找到证据（RLS支持不完整，待官方确认）。 CockroachDB 曾实验行级安全相关能力，但官方文档中 RLS 的支持状态不明确 / 不完整 待验证 当前行级隔离主要靠视图与应用层，或利用多租户 / 分区做隔离 社区共识 无内置动态脱敏引擎的公开说明 待验证</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>未找到证据</strong>（RLS支持不完整，待官方确认）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CockroachDB 曾实验行级安全相关能力，但官方文档中 RLS 的支持状态不明确 / 不完整 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n<li>当前行级隔离主要靠视图与应用层，或利用多租户 / 分区做隔离 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>无内置动态脱敏引擎的公开说明 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No evidence found</span><p class=\"snippet\">No evidence found (RLS support incomplete; confirm with vendor). CockroachDB has experimented with row-level security, but its support status in official docs is unclear …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>No evidence found</strong> (RLS support incomplete; confirm with vendor).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CockroachDB has experimented with row-level security, but its support status in official docs is unclear / incomplete <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n<li>Row isolation today relies on views and the app layer, or on multi-tenancy / partitioning <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>No public description of a built-in dynamic masking engine <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__28": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（JSONB 类型，PG 算子兼容）。 JSONB 类型，-&gt;/-&gt;&gt;/@&gt; 等 PG 兼容算子 官方文档。 GIN 索引支持弱于 PG，复杂 jsonb 查询性能注意 待验证。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（JSONB 类型，PG 算子兼容）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSONB 类型，-&gt;/-&gt;&gt;/@&gt; 等 PG 兼容算子 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>GIN 索引支持弱于 PG，复杂 jsonb 查询性能注意 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (JSONB with PG-compatible operators). JSONB type with PG-compatible -&gt;/-&gt;&gt;/@&gt; operators <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. GIN indexing weaker than PG; watch complex jsonb query …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (JSONB with PG-compatible operators).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSONB type with PG-compatible -&gt;/-&gt;&gt;/@&gt; operators <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>GIN indexing weaker than PG; watch complex jsonb query performance <code>(to be verified)</code>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__29": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无，生产外挂检索）。 无全文索引（查证为无）官方文档。 全文场景需外挂 ES/Typesense 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无，生产外挂检索）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无全文索引（查证为无）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>全文场景需外挂 ES/Typesense <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified absent; use external search). No full-text indexes (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Full-text needs external ES/Typesense <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified absent; use external search).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No full-text indexes (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Full-text needs external ES/Typesense <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。密码（SCRAM-SHA-256）、证书认证、RBAC 角色；OIDC/SSO、Kerberos 等多为 Enterprise / Cloud 付费层能力，具体矩阵待复核。来源等级：官方仓库资料 + 待验证</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。密码（SCRAM-SHA-256）、证书认证、RBAC 角色；OIDC/SSO、Kerberos 等多为 Enterprise / Cloud 付费层能力，具体矩阵待复核。来源等级：官方仓库资料 + 待验证</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. Passwords (SCRAM-SHA-256), certificate auth, RBAC roles; OIDC/SSO, Kerberos, etc. are mostly Enterprise / Cloud paid-tier capabilities — exact matrix pending v…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. Passwords (SCRAM-SHA-256), certificate auth, RBAC roles; OIDC/SSO, Kerberos, etc. are mostly Enterprise / Cloud paid-tier capabilities — exact matrix pending verification. Evidence level: official repo materials + to-be-verified</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__30": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（Pebble LSM+Snappy 压缩）。 存储引擎 Pebble（RocksDB 系）采用 LSM 结构，默认 Snappy 压缩，支持块级压缩配置。官方文档 多副本（默认 3 副本）带来 3 倍存储放大，压缩可部分抵消但无法消除。社区实测 备份与导入导出支持压缩，属运维层面能力。官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（Pebble LSM+Snappy 压缩）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>存储引擎 Pebble（RocksDB 系）采用 LSM 结构，默认 Snappy 压缩，支持块级压缩配置。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>多副本（默认 3 副本）带来 3 倍存储放大，压缩可部分抵消但无法消除。<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span></li>\n<li>备份与导入导出支持压缩，属运维层面能力。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Pebble LSM with Snappy compression). The Pebble storage engine (RocksDB lineage) uses LSM structure with default Snappy compression and configurable block comp…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Pebble LSM with Snappy compression).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The Pebble storage engine (RocksDB lineage) uses LSM structure with default Snappy compression and configurable block compression. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Default 3-way replication means 3x storage amplification; compression offsets it only partially. <code>(community tested)</code></li>\n<li>Backup and import/export support compression as an operational capability. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__31": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（曾从 Apache 2.0 转 BSL）。 CockroachDB 2019 年将核心从 Apache 2.0 转为 BSL（Business Source License），限制云厂商托管竞争，是明确的协议变更黑历史。官方文档 BSL 条款下自建使用仍免费，但二次分发与云托管受限。社区共识 CockroachDB Dedica…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（曾从 Apache 2.0 转 BSL）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CockroachDB 2019 年将核心从 Apache 2.0 转为 BSL（Business Source License），限制云厂商托管竞争，是明确的协议变更黑历史。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>BSL 条款下自建使用仍免费，但二次分发与云托管受限。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>CockroachDB Dedicated/Serverless 云版本进一步绑定其云平台。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Moved from Apache 2.0 to BSL). In 2019 CockroachDB moved its core from Apache 2.0 to BSL (Business Source License), restricting competing cloud hosting — a clear…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Moved from Apache 2.0 to BSL).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>In 2019 CockroachDB moved its core from Apache 2.0 to BSL (Business Source License), restricting competing cloud hosting — a clear license-change history. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>Self-hosting remains free under BSL, but redistribution and cloud hosting are restricted. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n<li>CockroachDB Dedicated/Serverless editions further bind users to its cloud platform. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__32": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（自研 CBO；EXPLAIN 完备；hint 有限）。 自研分布式 CBO，支持 EXPLAIN (OPT/VERBOSE) 官方文档。 hint 能力有限（不如 PG/Oracle），计划控制手段少 官方文档。 统计信息自动收集，计划翻转多与统计过期相关 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（自研 CBO；EXPLAIN 完备；hint 有限）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>自研分布式 CBO，支持 EXPLAIN (OPT/VERBOSE) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>hint 能力有限（不如 PG/Oracle），计划控制手段少 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>统计信息自动收集，计划翻转多与统计过期相关 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Homegrown CBO; full EXPLAIN; limited hints). Homegrown distributed CBO with EXPLAIN (OPT/VERBOSE) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Limited hint support (weaker than PG/Oracle)…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Homegrown CBO; full EXPLAIN; limited hints).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Homegrown distributed CBO with EXPLAIN (OPT/VERBOSE) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Limited hint support (weaker than PG/Oracle), few plan-control levers <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Statistics auto-collected; flips usually trace to stale stats <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__33": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（参数精简哲学；自动 rebalance）。 参数数量刻意精简，大量行为自动（副本 rebalance、range 分裂）官方文档。 DB Console 诊断完善，但深度调优点少 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（参数精简哲学；自动 rebalance）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>参数数量刻意精简，大量行为自动（副本 rebalance、range 分裂）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>DB Console 诊断完善，但深度调优点少 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Lean-parameter philosophy; strong auto-rebalance). Deliberately few parameters; much is automatic (replica rebalance, range splits) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. DB Console d…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Lean-parameter philosophy; strong auto-rebalance).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Deliberately few parameters; much is automatic (replica rebalance, range splits) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>DB Console diagnostics are solid, but deep tuning levers are few <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__34": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（存储引擎块级校验+三副本，用户侧无开关）。 底层 Pebble 存储引擎带块级 checksum，读路径可发现损坏块。待验证 Range 三副本 + Raft，单副本损坏可被多数派掩盖并修复。官方文档 无用户可见的页校验开关或全库校验命令，损坏审计能力有限。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（存储引擎块级校验+三副本，用户侧无开关）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>底层 Pebble 存储引擎带块级 checksum，读路径可发现损坏块。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n<li>Range 三副本 + Raft，单副本损坏可被多数派掩盖并修复。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>无用户可见的页校验开关或全库校验命令，损坏审计能力有限。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Block checks plus 3x replication). The underlying Pebble storage engine carries block-level checksums detectable on the read path. (to be verified) Triple-replic…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Block checks plus 3x replication).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>The underlying Pebble storage engine carries block-level checksums detectable on the read path. <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n<li>Triple-replicated ranges with Raft mask and repair single-copy corruption via quorum. <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No user-visible page checksum switch or full-database verification command; audit capability is limited. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__35": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无存储过程/触发器）。 无存储过程、触发器（查证为无）官方文档。 逻辑放应用层；去 O 迁移时 PL/SQL 需整体重写 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无存储过程/触发器）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无存储过程、触发器（查证为无）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>逻辑放应用层；去 O 迁移时 PL/SQL 需整体重写 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified: no stored procedures). No stored procedures or triggers (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Logic in app layer; Oracle PL/SQL must be fully rewrit…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified: no stored procedures).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No stored procedures or triggers (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Logic in app layer; Oracle PL/SQL must be fully rewritten <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__36": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（FK/CHECK 有，分布式下慎用）。 支持外键、CHECK、唯一约束 官方文档。 跨 range 外键检查有分布式代价，高吞吐写入建议应用层保证 官方文档。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（FK/CHECK 有，分布式下慎用）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>支持外键、CHECK、唯一约束 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨 range 外键检查有分布式代价，高吞吐写入建议应用层保证 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (FK/CHECK; careful when distributed). FK, CHECK, unique constraints supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cross-range FK checks cost; high-throughput writes better enforce…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (FK/CHECK; careful when distributed).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>FK, CHECK, unique constraints supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-range FK checks cost; high-throughput writes better enforced in app <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__37": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（窗口/CTE 有；递归有限）。 窗口函数、CTE 可用，PG 兼容度高 官方文档。 递归 CTE 与复杂分析性能弱于专用 OLAP 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（窗口/CTE 有；递归有限）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>窗口函数、CTE 可用，PG 兼容度高 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>递归 CTE 与复杂分析性能弱于专用 OLAP <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Windows/CTEs; limited recursion). Window functions and CTEs with high PG compatibility <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Recursive CTEs and heavy analytics lag dedicated OLAP (…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Windows/CTEs; limited recursion).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Window functions and CTEs with high PG compatibility <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Recursive CTEs and heavy analytics lag dedicated OLAP <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__38": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（手动DELETE；MVCC历史+备份残留）。 MVCC 下 DELETE 产生墓碑标记，GC 前旧版本可读；企业版备份保留历史 官方文档 无原生擦除证明，GDPR 删除需应用层编排“删行 + 轮转备份 + 审计” 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（手动DELETE；MVCC历史+备份残留）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>MVCC 下 DELETE 产生墓碑标记，GC 前旧版本可读；企业版备份保留历史 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>无原生擦除证明，GDPR 删除需应用层编排“删行 + 轮转备份 + 审计” <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Manual DELETE; MVCC history + backup residue). Under MVCC, DELETE writes tombstone markers and old versions stay readable until GC; enterprise backups retain his…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Manual DELETE; MVCC history + backup residue).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Under MVCC, DELETE writes tombstone markers and old versions stay readable until GC; enterprise backups retain history <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></li>\n<li>No native erasure attestation; GDPR deletion needs app-layer orchestration of delete plus backup rotation plus audit <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__39": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无原生血缘）。 无原生数据血缘/目录 官方文档。 依赖第三方治理平台 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无原生血缘）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无原生数据血缘/目录 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>依赖第三方治理平台 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified: no native lineage). No native data lineage/catalog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Depends on third-party governance platforms <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified: no native lineage).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No native data lineage/catalog <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Depends on third-party governance platforms <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（部分需 Enterprise）</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（部分需 Enterprise）。BACKUP / RESTORE SQL、增量备份、计划备份、PITR；全集群恢复需 enterprise license（Cockroach Labs 官方 university skill 明确）；恢复速度官方口径待复核；Cloud 提供托管备份（各 tier 保留期/能力待复核）。来源等级：官方仓…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有（部分需 Enterprise）</strong>。<code>BACKUP</code> / <code>RESTORE</code> SQL、增量备份、计划备份、PITR；全集群恢复需 enterprise license（Cockroach Labs 官方 university skill 明确）；恢复速度官方口径待复核；Cloud 提供托管备份（各 tier 保留期/能力待复核）。来源等级：官方仓库资料 + 待验证</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (partially Enterprise-only). BACKUP / RESTORE SQL, incremental backups, scheduled backups, PITR; full-cluster restore requires an enterprise license (stated exp…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported (partially Enterprise-only)</strong>. <code>BACKUP</code> / <code>RESTORE</code> SQL, incremental backups, scheduled backups, PITR; full-cluster restore requires an enterprise license (stated explicitly in Cockroach Labs&#x27; official university skill); restore-speed figures pending verification against official statements; Cloud offers managed backups (retention/capability per tier pending verification). Evidence level: official repo materials + to-be-verified</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__40": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（存算一体：Pebble 本地盘）。 每节点 Pebble（RocksDB 衍生）本地存储，存算一体 官方文档。 扩缩容自动 rebalance，但数据搬迁耗时 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（存算一体：Pebble 本地盘）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每节点 Pebble（RocksDB 衍生）本地存储，存算一体 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>扩缩容自动 rebalance，但数据搬迁耗时 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Coupled: Pebble local disks). Each node stores on local Pebble (RocksDB-derived); coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Scaling auto-rebalances, but data movement takes tim…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Coupled: Pebble local disks).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Each node stores on local Pebble (RocksDB-derived); coupled <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Scaling auto-rebalances, but data movement takes time <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__41": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（PG 兼容多模：JSONB+全文+向量）。 JSONB、全文检索、pgvector 兼容（PG 生态）官方文档。 无原生图引擎 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（PG 兼容多模：JSONB+全文+向量）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSONB、全文检索、pgvector 兼容（PG 生态）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>无原生图引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (PG-compatible multi-model: JSONB+full-text+vectors). JSONB, full-text, pgvector-compatible (PG ecosystem) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. No native graph engine (community cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (PG-compatible multi-model: JSONB+full-text+vectors).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>JSONB, full-text, pgvector-compatible (PG ecosystem) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>No native graph engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__42": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（云版按量计费，标签与预算能力有限）。 CockroachDB Cloud 按请求/计算单元计量，提供用量视图。厂商口径 成本标签与预算告警能力弱于主流云数仓，细粒度归因有限。待验证 自建版无计费概念，成本=硬件+运维人力自理。社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（云版按量计费，标签与预算能力有限）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CockroachDB Cloud 按请求/计算单元计量，提供用量视图。<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>成本标签与预算告警能力弱于主流云数仓，细粒度归因有限。<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span></li>\n<li>自建版无计费概念，成本=硬件+运维人力自理。<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Partial</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partial (Cloud metering; weak tagging/budgets). CockroachDB Cloud meters requests/compute units with usage views. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span> Cost tagging and budget-alert capabilitie…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partial</strong> (Cloud metering; weak tagging/budgets).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>CockroachDB Cloud meters requests/compute units with usage views. <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span></li>\n<li>Cost tagging and budget-alert capabilities lag mainstream cloud warehouses; fine-grained attribution is limited. <code>(to be verified)</code></li>\n<li>Self-hosted edition has no metering; cost is hardware plus operations labor. <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__43": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（PG 协议兼容，驱动直接复用）。 PG 线协议兼容，pgjdbc/psqlODBC/libpq 直接可用 官方文档。 部分 PG 高级特性驱动层需注意兼容 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（PG 协议兼容，驱动直接复用）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PG 线协议兼容，pgjdbc/psqlODBC/libpq 直接可用 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>部分 PG 高级特性驱动层需注意兼容 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (PG-protocol compatible; reuse drivers). PG wire-protocol compatible; pgjdbc/psqlODBC/libpq work directly <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Some advanced PG features need driver…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (PG-protocol compatible; reuse drivers).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PG wire-protocol compatible; pgjdbc/psqlODBC/libpq work directly <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Some advanced PG features need driver-level compatibility care <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__44": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无</span><p class=\"snippet\">无（查证为无物化视图能力）。 无物化视图（查证为无）官方文档。 预聚合靠应用层或下游 OLAP 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>无</strong>（查证为无物化视图能力）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>无物化视图（查证为无）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>预聚合靠应用层或下游 OLAP <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">Not supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Not supported (Verified: no materialized views). No materialized views (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Pre-aggregation via app layer or downstream OLAP (community cons…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Not supported</strong> (Verified: no materialized views).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>No materialized views (verified absent) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Pre-aggregation via app layer or downstream OLAP <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__45": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（自建任意云；CockroachDB Cloud 多云）。 开源/企业自建版任意云可部署 官方文档。 CockroachDB Cloud 支持 AWS/GCP 官方文档。 跨云多活理论可行，延迟与成本是现实门槛 社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>（自建任意云；CockroachDB Cloud 多云）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>开源/企业自建版任意云可部署 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>CockroachDB Cloud 支持 AWS/GCP <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>跨云多活理论可行，延迟与成本是现实门槛 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Self-hosted on any cloud; CockroachDB Cloud multi-cloud). Open-source/enterprise self-hosted deploys on any cloud <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CockroachDB Cloud supports A…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Self-hosted on any cloud; CockroachDB Cloud multi-cloud).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Open-source/enterprise self-hosted deploys on any cloud <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>CockroachDB Cloud supports AWS/GCP <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Cross-cloud active-active is theoretically possible; latency and cost are the real gates <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__46": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（冲突转 40001 重试，单行热点靠应用）。 并发控制原语：默认 SERIALIZABLE 乐观执行；作用于同一索引键或列族的事务被严格串行化，冲突时一方被打上 40001（restart transaction）重试错误，这是争用下的正常操作而非故障 官方文档。 重试责任：隐式单语句事务由内核静默自动重试；显式多语句事务必须由…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（冲突转 40001 重试，单行热点靠应用）。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>并发控制原语：默认 SERIALIZABLE 乐观执行；作用于同一索引键或列族的事务被严格串行化，冲突时一方被打上 40001（restart transaction）重试错误，这是争用下的正常操作而非故障 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>重试责任：隐式单语句事务由内核静默自动重试；显式多语句事务必须由应用层（或 ORM 的 CockroachDB 重试适配器）实现重试循环，否则 40001 直接暴露为用户可见错误 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>衰减形态：热点行在 range leaseholder 处串行；高并发热点下重试风暴推高延迟，重试次数随冲突率放大；同 key 热点是 leaseholder 单点串行，加节点无法分担 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>内置缓解：range 按负载自动分裂可缓解热点 range，但单行热点无法通过分裂打散；leaseholder 协调读写，热点 leaseholder 本身是单点 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>应用层模式：官方建议用 SELECT FOR UPDATE 强制串行化临界区、UPSERT 合并写、按访问模式分离列族以缩小锁冲突面；顺序键改用 gen_random_uuid 或 hash-sharded 索引打散（主要针对顺序写入热点）；代价是 schema 改造成本与重试逻辑侵入业务 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported(Conflicts become 40001 retries; single-row hotspots are the application&#x27;s problem). Locking primitive: optimistic execution at SERIALIZABLE by default…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong>(Conflicts become 40001 retries; single-row hotspots are the application&#x27;s problem).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Locking primitive: optimistic execution at SERIALIZABLE by default; transactions touching the same index key or column family are strictly serialized, and one side of a conflict gets a 40001 (<code>restart transaction</code>) retry error — normal operation under contention, not a failure <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Retry responsibility: implicit single-statement transactions are retried silently by the kernel; explicit multi-statement transactions must be wrapped in a retry loop by the application (or a CockroachDB-aware ORM adapter), otherwise 40001 surfaces as a user-visible error <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Degradation: a hot row serializes at the range leaseholder; under heavy hotspot contention retry storms inflate latency, with retry counts scaling alongside conflict rates; a same-key hotspot is leaseholder serialization, which adding nodes cannot relieve <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Built-in mitigation: load-based range splitting relieves hot ranges but cannot disperse a single-row hotspot; the leaseholder coordinates reads and writes and is itself a single point <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Application patterns: the official guidance recommends SELECT FOR UPDATE to force serialized critical sections, UPSERT to merge writes, and splitting column families by access pattern to shrink the lock-conflict surface; sequential keys should use <code>gen_random_uuid()</code> or hash-sharded indexes (mainly for sequential-write hotspots); the cost is schema-remodeling effort and retry logic leaking into business code <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。DB Console（:8080）、SQL Activity、statement diagnostics、Prometheus metrics 端点。但注意：pg_stat_statements 不可用（PG 生态监控工具链迁移时的明确缺口）。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。DB Console（:8080）、SQL Activity、statement diagnostics、Prometheus metrics 端点。但注意：<strong><code>pg_stat_statements</code> 不可用</strong>（PG 生态监控工具链迁移时的明确缺口）。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. DB Console (:8080), SQL Activity, statement diagnostics, Prometheus metrics endpoint. But note: pg_stat_statements is NOT available (an explicit gap when migra…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. DB Console (:8080), SQL Activity, statement diagnostics, Prometheus metrics endpoint. But note: <strong><code>pg_stat_statements</code> is NOT available</strong> (an explicit gap when migrating the PG ecosystem monitoring toolchain). Evidence level: official docs + community consensus</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持。每个节点都是 SQL 网关，客户端应配置多节点地址或经 LB 分散连接；官方对接 PG 驱动生态（port 26257）；官方是否自带连接池（pgBouncer 式）未找到证据——未找到证据，待验证。来源等级：官方文档 + 待验证</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>部分支持</strong>。每个节点都是 SQL 网关，客户端应配置多节点地址或经 LB 分散连接；官方对接 PG 驱动生态（port 26257）；官方是否自带连接池（pgBouncer 式）未找到证据——<strong>未找到证据</strong>，待验证。来源等级：官方文档 + 待验证</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported. Every node is an SQL gateway; clients should configure multiple node addresses or spread connections via an LB; official integration targets the PG d…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong>. Every node is an SQL gateway; clients should configure multiple node addresses or spread connections via an LB; official integration targets the PG driver ecosystem (port 26257); whether the official distribution ships a built-in connection pooler (pgBouncer-style) — <strong>no evidence found</strong>, to-be-verified. Evidence level: official docs + to-be-verified</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。默认 Serializable；v23.2 起可选 READ COMMITTED（v26.3 的默认与语义细节待官方复核）。机制：MVCC + write intents + transaction record，多 Range 事务走 2PC，Parallel Commits 把提交关键路径压到约 1 轮共识 RTT。来源等级：官方…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。默认 <strong>Serializable</strong>；v23.2 起可选 READ COMMITTED（v26.3 的默认与语义细节待官方复核）。机制：MVCC + write intents + transaction record，多 Range 事务走 2PC，Parallel Commits 把提交关键路径压到约 1 轮共识 RTT。来源等级：官方文档 + 第三方技术资料</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. Default is Serializable; READ COMMITTED became optional in v23.2 (v26.3 default and semantic details pending official verification). Mechanism: MVCC + write in…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. Default is <strong>Serializable</strong>; READ COMMITTED became optional in v23.2 (v26.3 default and semantic details pending official verification). Mechanism: MVCC + write intents + transaction record; multi-Range transactions go through 2PC; Parallel Commits compresses the commit critical path to roughly 1 round of consensus RTT. Evidence level: official docs + third-party statement</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。每 Range 一个 Raft group + leaseholder 协调读写，默认强一致；另有 follower reads（AS OF SYSTEM TIME follower_read_timestamp()）提供有界陈旧读。来源等级：官方设计文档 / RFC + 第三方资料</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。每 Range 一个 Raft group + leaseholder 协调读写，默认强一致；另有 follower reads（<code>AS OF SYSTEM TIME follower_read_timestamp()</code>）提供有界陈旧读。来源等级：官方设计文档 / RFC + 第三方资料</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. One Raft group per Range + leaseholder coordinating reads/writes, strongly consistent by default; plus follower reads (AS OF SYSTEM TIME follower_read_timestam…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. One Raft group per Range + leaseholder coordinating reads/writes, strongly consistent by default; plus follower reads (<code>AS OF SYSTEM TIME follower_read_timestamp()</code>) for bounded-staleness reads. Evidence level: official design docs / RFCs + third-party statement</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cockroachdb__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。横向 scale-out 在线扩容，加节点后 Range 自动 rebalance；节点纵向升级配置亦可。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>有</strong>。横向 scale-out 在线扩容，加节点后 Range 自动 rebalance；节点纵向升级配置亦可。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported. Horizontal scale-out is online — new nodes are added and Ranges automatically rebalance; vertical node upgrades are also possible. Evidence level: official doc…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong>. Horizontal scale-out is online — new nodes are added and Ranges automatically rebalance; vertical node upgrades are also possible. Evidence level: official docs + community consensus</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">数据实际落在客户自己的云存储（S3/ADLS/GCS），默认走云厂商服务端加密（SSE）；控制面元数据由 Databricks 加密 官方文档。 支持客户管理密钥（CMK/Customer-managed keys）：密钥存客户自己的 KMS（AWS KMS / Azure Key Vault），可覆盖工作区存储与 Unity Catal…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>数据实际落在客户自己的云存储（S3/ADLS/GCS），默认走云厂商服务端加密（SSE）；控制面元数据由 Databricks 加密 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>支持客户管理密钥（CMK/Customer-managed keys）：密钥存客户自己的 KMS（AWS KMS / Azure Key Vault），可覆盖工作区存储与 Unity Catalog 元存储 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>合规安全配置文件（Compliance Security Profile）可强制加密与密钥策略，是过 HIPAA/PCI 等认证的前置条件 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (cloud SSE + optional customer-managed keys). Data physically lands in the customer&#x27;s own cloud storage (S3/ADLS/GCS) under cloud-native server-side encryption …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (cloud SSE + optional customer-managed keys).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Data physically lands in the customer&#x27;s own cloud storage (S3/ADLS/GCS) under cloud-native server-side encryption (SSE); control-plane metadata is encrypted by Databricks <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Customer-managed keys (CMK) supported: keys live in the customer&#x27;s own KMS (AWS KMS / Azure Key Vault) and can cover workspace storage and the Unity Catalog metastore <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>The Compliance Security Profile can enforce encryption and key policies — a prerequisite for HIPAA/PCI-style certifications <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有（TLS 1.2+ 全链路）</span><p class=\"snippet\">控制面与计算面之间所有通信 TLS 加密；Secure Cluster Connectivity 走加密 WebSocket 隧道 官方文档。 JDBC/ODBC、REST API、Notebook 流量均为 HTTPS/TLS；官方安全基线要求 TLS 1.2 以上 社区共识。 无明文回退：不存在&quot;开了 TLS 还留着明文端口&quot;的自建式…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>控制面与计算面之间所有通信 TLS 加密；Secure Cluster Connectivity 走加密 WebSocket 隧道 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>JDBC/ODBC、REST API、Notebook 流量均为 HTTPS/TLS；官方安全基线要求 TLS 1.2 以上 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>无明文回退：不存在&quot;开了 TLS 还留着明文端口&quot;的自建式坑，端口暴露面由云网络配置决定 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (TLS 1.2+ end to end). All control-plane to compute-plane traffic is TLS-encrypted; Secure Cluster Connectivity runs over an encrypted WebSocket tunnel (officia…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (TLS 1.2+ end to end).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>All control-plane to compute-plane traffic is TLS-encrypted; Secure Cluster Connectivity runs over an encrypted WebSocket tunnel <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>JDBC/ODBC, REST API and notebook traffic are all HTTPS/TLS; the official security baseline requires TLS 1.2+ <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>No plaintext fallback: unlike self-managed setups there is no &quot;TLS on but plaintext ports left open&quot; trap — the exposed surface is governed by cloud network configuration <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">API：完整 Spark API（DataFrame/SQL/Streaming/MLlib），PySpark 是事实标准入口；Databricks Runtime 是优化版 Spark 官方文档。 表格式：Delta Lake 底层是 Parquet + 事务日志，任何能读 Parquet 的引擎都能读数据；与 Apache Icebe…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>API：完整 Spark API（DataFrame/SQL/Streaming/MLlib），PySpark 是事实标准入口；Databricks Runtime 是优化版 Spark <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>表格式：Delta Lake 底层是 Parquet + 事务日志，任何能读 Parquet 的引擎都能读数据；与 Apache Iceberg 互读能力持续增强（UniForm 等），&quot;换引擎不搬数据&quot;是卖点 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：开放的是数据格式，不是平台 API——作业调度、权限、计费都绑定 Databricks 控制面；Photon 是闭源加速引擎 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Spark API + open-format interop). API: full Spark API (DataFrame/SQL/Streaming/MLlib); PySpark is the de-facto entry point; Databricks Runtime is an optimized …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Spark API + open-format interop).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>API: full Spark API (DataFrame/SQL/Streaming/MLlib); PySpark is the de-facto entry point; Databricks Runtime is an optimized Spark distribution <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Table formats: Delta Lake is Parquet plus a transaction log underneath — any Parquet-capable engine can read the data; interop with Apache Iceberg keeps improving (UniForm and friends), and &quot;change engines without moving data&quot; is a selling point <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Note: the open part is the data format, not the platform API — job scheduling, permissions and billing are bound to the Databricks control plane; Photon is a closed-source acceleration engine <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">平台专有、无开源/自建版本：必须跑在 Databricks 账号体系下（AWS/Azure/GCP 三家云），不存在&quot;下载一个 Databricks 装到自己机房&quot; 官方文档。 计费：DBU × 时长 × 工作负载类型费率；经典计算另付云资源费，Serverless 打包；企业合同价与目录价差异大 厂商口径。 开源部分：Delta Lak…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>平台专有、无开源/自建版本：必须跑在 Databricks 账号体系下（AWS/Azure/GCP 三家云），不存在&quot;下载一个 Databricks 装到自己机房&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>计费：DBU × 时长 × 工作负载类型费率；经典计算另付云资源费，Serverless 打包；企业合同价与目录价差异大 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>开源部分：Delta Lake（Linux 基金会）、MLflow、Apache Spark 本体开源，数据不被格式锁定是相对 Snowflake 的差异化 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (proprietary platform on DBU consumption; core components open source). Proprietary platform, no open-source/self-hosted edition: it only runs under a Databrick…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (proprietary platform on DBU consumption; core components open source).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Proprietary platform, no open-source/self-hosted edition: it only runs under a Databricks account on AWS/Azure/GCP — there is no &quot;download Databricks and install it in your own data center&quot; <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Billing: DBUs × duration × workload-type rate; classic compute adds cloud-resource fees, Serverless bundles them; enterprise contract pricing differs substantially from list <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Open-source parts: Delta Lake (Linux Foundation), MLflow and Apache Spark itself are open — data is not format-locked, which is the differentiator against Snowflake-style proprietary storage <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持（英文优先，中文在增长）</span><p class=\"snippet\">官方文档以英文为主，部分有机器翻译中文；Azure Databricks 有较多中文文档（微软生态）社区共识。 中文博客/课程在增长（CSDN、知乎、极客时间有 Databricks 系列），但深度内容（调优、Unity Catalog 迁移实战）英文仍多一个身位 社区共识。 认证体系（Data Engineer Professional…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>官方文档以英文为主，部分有机器翻译中文；Azure Databricks 有较多中文文档（微软生态）<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>中文博客/课程在增长（CSDN、知乎、极客时间有 Databricks 系列），但深度内容（调优、Unity Catalog 迁移实战）英文仍多一个身位 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>认证体系（Data Engineer Professional 等）为英文考试 <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (English-first, Chinese catching up). Official docs are English-first with partial machine-translated Chinese; Azure Databricks has more Chinese docum…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (English-first, Chinese catching up).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Official docs are English-first with partial machine-translated Chinese; Azure Databricks has more Chinese documentation via the Microsoft ecosystem <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Chinese blogs and courses are growing (CSDN, Zhihu, Geektime series), but deep content (tuning, Unity Catalog migration war stories) still runs a generation behind English <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Certification exams (e.g. Data Engineer Professional) are English-only <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Photon 向量化引擎：官方口径称相对开源 Spark 有数倍提升（TPC-DS 类基准），是 SQL 仓库与 DLT 的默认加速 厂商口径。 典型延迟：SQL 仓库交互式查询秒级（TB 级聚合常见，社区多方实测）；流处理端到端秒级；2026 年发布的 Lakehouse//RT（实时引擎 Reyden）把目标打到亚秒级并发查询 社区实…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>Photon 向量化引擎：官方口径称相对开源 Spark 有数倍提升（TPC-DS 类基准），是 SQL 仓库与 DLT 的默认加速 <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>。</li>\n<li>典型延迟：SQL 仓库交互式查询秒级（TB 级聚合常见，社区多方实测）；流处理端到端秒级；2026 年发布的 Lakehouse//RT（实时引擎 Reyden）把目标打到亚秒级并发查询 <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</li>\n<li>边界：毫秒级点查/高频 OLTP 不是设计目标；冷启动（经典集群拉起）曾是主要吐槽，Serverless 大幅缓解但仍非零 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (Photon batch benchmark; interactive in seconds; OLTP not the target). Photon vectorized engine: vendor-claimed multi-fold speedups over open-source Spark on TP…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (Photon batch benchmark; interactive in seconds; OLTP not the target).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Photon vectorized engine: vendor-claimed multi-fold speedups over open-source Spark on TPC-DS-style benchmarks; the default accelerator for SQL warehouses and DLT <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.</li>\n<li>Typical latencies: interactive SQL-warehouse queries in seconds (TB-scale aggregations commonly measured by the community); streaming end-to-end in seconds; the 2026 Lakehouse//RT launch (Reyden engine) targets sub-second concurrent queries <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>.</li>\n<li>Boundary: millisecond point lookups / high-frequency OLTP are not the design target; cluster cold starts (classic) were the classic complaint — Serverless mitigates substantially but not to zero <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__14": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">SOC 2 Type II、ISO/IEC 27001（2022 版，覆盖 AWS/Azure/GCP 三云）、ISO 27017/27018/27701、HIPAA、PCI-DSS、FedRAMP（指定区域）官方文档。 合规安全配置文件（Compliance Security Profile）一键强化：FIPS 加密模块、增强审计等，是…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>SOC 2 Type II、ISO/IEC 27001（2022 版，覆盖 AWS/Azure/GCP 三云）、ISO 27017/27018/27701、HIPAA、PCI-DSS、FedRAMP（指定区域）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>合规安全配置文件（Compliance Security Profile）一键强化：FIPS 加密模块、增强审计等，是过等保/金融合规的标配动作 <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n<li>注意：部分 AI 功能（如按 token 计费的 Foundation Model API）在非 HIPAA 合规档下受限；中国区无本地云（需经全球云部署）<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (full SOC2/ISO/HIPAA/PCI/FedRAMP suite). SOC 2 Type II, ISO/IEC 27001:2022 (covering AWS/Azure/GCP), ISO 27017/27018/27701, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, FedRAMP (in designat…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (full SOC2/ISO/HIPAA/PCI/FedRAMP suite).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>SOC 2 Type II, ISO/IEC 27001:2022 (covering AWS/Azure/GCP), ISO 27017/27018/27701, HIPAA, PCI-DSS, FedRAMP (in designated regions) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>The Compliance Security Profile hardens in one switch — FIPS crypto modules, enhanced auditing — the standard move for regulated/financial compliance <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n<li>Note: some AI features (pay-per-token Foundation Model APIs) are restricted outside HIPAA-class compliance profiles; no China-region cloud (deploy via global clouds) <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "databricks__15": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">2013 年由 Spark 原班团队创立，总部旧金山，员工 8000+（2025-2026 口径）；2024 年 12 月估值 620 亿美元，2025 年底超千亿美元，仍未 IPO 社区共识。 Spark 本体社区与 Databricks 生态高度重叠：技术问答、第三方书籍、认证体系成熟；Delta Lake、MLflow 开源社区活跃…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><ul>\n<li>2013 年由 Spark 原班团队创立，总部旧金山，员工 8000+（2025-2026 口径）；2024 年 12 月估值 620 亿美元，2025 年底超千亿美元，仍未 IPO <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>Spark 本体社区与 Databricks 生态高度重叠：技术问答、第三方书籍、认证体系成熟；Delta Lake、MLflow 开源社区活跃 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n<li>风险面：未上市公司的长期定价与战略存在不确定性；平台迭代快，API/默认行为变更需要跟进 <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported (founded 2013; the de-facto Spark-ecosystem standard). Founded 2013 by the original Spark team, HQ San Francisco, 8,000+ employees (2025–2026 figures); valued a…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><p><strong>Supported</strong> (founded 2013; the de-facto Spark-ecosystem standard).</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Founded 2013 by the original Spark team, HQ San Francisco, 8,000+ employees (2025–2026 figures); valued at $62B in Dec 2024, north of $100B by end of 2025, still private <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>The Spark open-source community and the Databricks ecosystem heavily overlap: Q&amp;A, third-party books and a mature certification system; Delta Lake and MLflow open-source communities are active <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n<li>Risk side: as a private company, long-term pricing and strategy carry uncertainty; the platform iterates fast and API/default-behavior changes need tracking <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});